1	// The PreToolUse verdict, three duties in this order (the runner in
2	// hook-runner.mjs writes it; nothing here exits or writes):
3	//  - a file tool (Edit, Write, NotebookEdit) aimed at a path one of an active
4	//    pack's skills names under `force-load-on-file-edits-paths` — or any tool
5	//    call one names under `force-load-on-tool-calls` — is blocked until the
6	//    session has loaded that skill, so the skill is read before the first edit
7	//    or call exists, not after a Stop-time finding has sent the agent back over
8	//    work done;
9	//  - the active packs' ACTION declarations (`scope: "action"`, `guardToolCalls` —
10	//    the vocabulary in engine/checks/helpers/pattern-rules.mjs) are judged
11	//    against the call about to run: a blocking finding denies it and hands the
12	//    agent the finding's text, an advisory one lets it run and injects the text
13	//    as context, so a bias is heard at the moment it applies. The context
14	//    carries no permissionDecision: `allow` would skip the permission prompt
15	//    for the call, and an advisory has no business approving anything. The
16	//    same declarations run again over the transcript at Stop, advisory
17	//    there whatever the severity — the record for a hook that never fired;
18	//  - a Bash command that deletes a remote branch is blocked (the delete-push
19	//    fails in this environment, so it can never succeed).
20	// Registered on every tool (the converge's PRETOOLUSE_MATCHER) — see
21	// bootstrap.md. A call no declaration names costs the cached context read
22	// (hook-context.mjs) and says nothing. A guard that cannot decide lets the call
23	// through: an unreadable declaration or registry is the mount self-test's
24	// finding, never a session wedged on tools.
25	import { isAbsolute, relative, resolve, sep } from 'node:path';
26	import { hooklog } from '../checks/helpers/hook-log.mjs';
27	import { applyGrace } from '../checks/helpers/findings.mjs';
28	import { guardFindings } from '../checks/helpers/pattern-rules.mjs';
29	import { missingSkillsFor, missingSkillsForCall } from '../pack_loader/path-scoped-skills.mjs';
30	import { hookContext, sessionReader, loadInstruction } from './hook-context.mjs';
